        "Id": "366d7b23-d31c-4f40-96eb-a34435a81673",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "Death of the Delgado Cartel",
        "Location": "LOCATION_COLOMBIA",
        "PublicId": "112037681436",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/colombia/scene_hippo.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 00df867e-f27f-4904-8bc7-9504443ccb5a).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47. We&apos;ve got another set of targets that need to be eliminated. The targets are the Delgado family, who run the Delgado drug cartel. The family consists of the leader Rico Delgado, his brother Hector, and his wife Catalina. You must also eliminate Rico&apos;s two lieutenants Jorge Franco and Andrea Martinez. Your client, Esteban Montoya, the leader of the Moreno cartel, believes that eliminating all of the key members of the Delgado cartel will pave a path for his success. Good luck 47.",
